and`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"a4201b62d6933380bcaaba443fd113f3","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"3d313f97ecd25d593bc6ec3a01b2b732","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6229f1835f6b672791fc4859db181436","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"9c9c6a22c45261e14e920b52b1ebb415","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"81fc0afbe1835b7763a02b1545a80e52","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"e62e4b8f7c4365a9ec408f89efc68887","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"134849684241429a012a3316bd851dd8","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"e9694554530508762b9920c4acb30491","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"5cb0a9c6a08e31ed98bf082c4e90c406","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794932669917,"stop":1794932670021,"duration":104,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value